Subject: [PATCH 5/5] fix(ai): keep provider error type, code and request
 endpoint in Test failure details

The HTTP helper now keeps error.type, error.code and error.status next to
error.message, and names the request endpoint (POST <url>). The key is
removed before the text is cut. The settings Test names the provider base
URL, not only the host.

